    <p>Norway has one of the world's strongest, most stable and most advanced economies. The country consistently ranks among global leaders in quality of life, GDP per capita and the Human Development Index (HDI). Despite a population of only about <strong>5.5 million people</strong>, Norway is one of Europe's wealthiest nations per capita. Its economic model combines a free-market economy with a comprehensive welfare system and effective public governance.</p>

